{
  "title": "Upgrade the general and image AI models (still google/gemini-2.5-flash from mid-2025) with human-judged evals",
  "description": "ramekin-core/src/ai/config.rs still defaults the general model (RAMEKIN_AI_MODEL: auto-tag, title normalization, description generation, custom enrich) to google/gemini-2.5-flash and the image model (RAMEKIN_AI_IMAGE_MODEL: generate_recipe_photo.rs) to google/gemini-2.5-flash-image. \
Prod sets neither. \
Ingredient names and weights (RAMEKIN_AI_INGREDIENT_MODEL, anthropic/claude-opus-5.5) and text/photo extraction (RAMEKIN_AI_EXTRACTION_MODEL, anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5) already have their own models, chosen with `make ai-eval` (data/ai-evals/).\n\
\n\
Remaining:\n\
1. \
Human-judged suites in the `make ai-eval` framework for tags (existing tags aren't reliable ground truth), titles, descriptions, custom enrich, and recipe photos: render a blind side-by-side page per suite whose picks become golden answers. \
The cached harnesses (make title-normalization-test, make description-generation-test) are a starting point.\n\
2. \
Pick the general model per feature if the evals disagree (tagging and descriptions can use the cheapest good model), and the image model from OpenRouter's image-output models (check the live catalog; google/gemini-3.1-flash-image and google/gemini-3-pro-image were current on 2026-10-04). \
Update the defaults, dev.env.example and cli.env.example.\n\
3. \
Add a handwritten recipe card and a phone screenshot to the photo-extraction suite (data/ai-evals/photos/); the five current photos are printed pages.\n\
\n\
Also relevant: a 2026-07-28 prod job failed on an upstream Gemini rate limit (see p3-openrouter-finish-reason-error).\n\
\n\
Lessons from the earlier suites: when a strong model looks weak, check the measurement first. \
Anthropic models wrap JSON in markdown fences or explain before it (the client extracts it); models answer free-text fields as bare numbers (\"servings\": 4), which the extraction prompts now accept; reasoning models need far more than 4096 max_tokens (gemini-3.8-flash truncated a dense photo at 4096 twice in a row); a vague prompt penalizes careful models most; golden sets drawn from catalog aliases need equivalence scoring; a scorer must accept text a model sensibly moves (a closing tip into notes) and values it reads off the source (a bake time from the steps). \
OpenAI models (gpt-6-luna, gpt-6.1-sol) return finish_reason content_filter on some ordinary recipes (shakshuka, red lentil soup), which rules them out wherever that recipe text is input. \
Rejected answers aren't cached, so a rerun re-asks them and the Invalid column can move between runs.",
